    "content": [
     {
      "text": "grace -- Grace (imparted). 2 Thessalonians 1:12; Romans 6:1; 2 Peter 3:18."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 12,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Epaphras -- A touching illustration of priestly service, (See Scofield \"1 Peter 2:9\") as distinguished from ministry of gift. Shut up in prison, no longer able to preach, Epaphras was still, equally with all believers, a priest. No prison could keep him from the throne of grace, so he gave himself wholly to the priestly work of intercession.\n\nperfect -- (See Scofield \"Matthew 5:48\")."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
